&lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/media_player/">Media Player Components&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>The &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/i2c">I²C bus&lt;/a> is required in your configuration as this is used to communicate with the ES8156.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="code-block">
